# Godot's import cache and per-machine editor state. Regenerated on open.
.godot/
.import/

# Export output, film frames and check logs - everything a tool writes in here.
#
# `build/*` and not `build/`: a bare `build/` stops git descending into the
# directory at all, so the `!build/.gdignore` below could never match.
build/*
# ...except the marker that stops Godot importing and EXPORTING what films and
# exports leave in there. Without it the exporter packed 3,720 filmed PNG frames
# into an APK and it came out at 1.42 GB against a 28 MB budget.
!build/.gdignore
*.apk
*.aab
*.idsig

# Never commit signing material. The debug keystore is universally known and
# still does not belong here; the release keystore would be a real key leak.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
